nsforms & spatial queries 7\n  # WLD.ENV Environment systems 20\n  # WLD.PCG Procedural generation 5\n  # WLD.VOX Voxel worlds 4\n  # WLD.TOOL World & environment authoring tools 6\n## RND Rendering\n  # RND.ARCH Render architecture 10\n  # RND.RHI Hardware interface 27\n  # RND.MEM GPU memory & resources 6\n  # RND.GRAPH Render graph & GPU scheduling 10\n  # RND.SHADER Shader system 17\n  # RND.MAT Materials 8\n  # RND.GEO GPU-driven geometry pipeline 11\n  # RND.LOD Level of detail & virtualized geometry 8\n  # RND.TEX Textures & virtual texturing 6\n  # RND.LIGHT Direct lighting & shadows 10\n  # RND.GI Global illumination & reflections 11\n  # RND.RT Ray tracing infrastructure 9\n  # RND.PT Path tracing 3\n  # RND.RECON Reconstruction, resolution & denoising 11\n  # RND.POST Post-processing, HDR & color 9\n  # RND.TRANS Translucency & decals 4\n  # RND.CHAR Character rendering 5\n  # RND.2D 2D, vector & UI rendering 7\n  # RND.VFX Particles & VFX 6\n  # RND.GPU GPU platform 3\n  # RND.MEDIA Media playback 5\n  # RND.TOOL Rendering authoring tools 5\n## ML Machine-learning runtime\n  # ML.RT Inference 6\n## PHY Physics & simulation\n  # PHY.ARCH Physics architecture 14\n  # PHY.COL Collision 9\n  # PHY.DYN Rigid-body dynamics 9\n  # PHY.CTRL Characters & vehicles 8\n  # PHY.SOFT Deformables 5\n  # PHY.DEST Destruction 3\n  # PHY.FLUID Fluids 4\n  # PHY.2D 2D physics 4\n  # PHY.TOOL Physics authoring tools 7\n## ANM Animation\n  # ANM.ARCH Animation architecture 7\n  # ANM.RT Animation runtime 7\n  # ANM.DEF Skinning & deformation 7\n  # ANM.GRAPH Animation graphs 4\n  # ANM.SYN Motion synthesis 4\n  # ANM.IK IK, procedural & physical animation 5\n  # ANM.FACE Facial animation 3\n  # ANM.CINE Cinematics 6\n  # ANM.TOOL Animation authoring tools 7\n## AUD Audio\n  # AUD.ARCH Audio architecture 9\n  # AUD.DSP DSP & mixing 8\n  # AUD.SPAT Spatial audio & acoustics 6\n  # AUD.CONTENT Audio content runtime 7\n  # AUD.TOOL Audio authoring tools 1\n## INP Input\n  # INP.