set-import-interchange', 'platform-services', 'media-playback', 'narrative-dialogue', 'navigation-pathfinding', 'ai-behavior-perception', 'cinematics-sequencer', 'packaging-release-patching', 'physics-tools'] The indie-2d reference game is shippable on PC with editor, save, localization, accessibility baseline and hot reload; indie-2d-tools configuration builds.\nM2 standard-3d-client ['geometry-pipeline', 'virtualized-geometry-lod', 'direct-lighting-shadows', 'global-illumination', 'ray-tracing-infrastructure', 'translucency-decals', 'atmosphere-weather', 'terrain', 'water-ocean', 'vegetation-foliage', 'collision-detection', 'rigid-body-dynamics', 'character-physics', 'cloth-deformables', 'ik-procedural-animation', 'deformation-skinning', 'facial-animation', 'spatial-audio-acoustics', 'character-rendering', 'path-tracing', 'rhi-d3d12', 'rhi-metal', 'platform-console', 'platform-mobile', 'collaboration-version-control', 'destruction-fracture'] The standard-3d reference game runs on PC and one console tier with GPU-driven and CPU-submission paths, reference path tracer validation, and the lite-3d mobile configuration.\nM3 open-world-client ['procedural-generation', 'crowd-simulation', 'motion-synthesis', 'vehicle-physics'] Open-world reference slice streams at target speed within the arbitration budget; massim configuration closed and benchmarked.\nM4 online-3d-server ['network-architect', 'network-transport', 'replication', 'prediction-rollback', 'dedicated-server', 'anti-cheat-integrity', 'online-services-liveops'] Online reference game with dedicated server, prediction/rollback, bot load test and cert pre-checks for online features.\nM5 aaa-open-world-online-client ['ml-inference-runtime', 'fluid-simulation', 'modding-ugc', 'xr-runtime', 'platform-web', 'rhi-webgpu', 'ai-assisted-authoring', 'voxel-worlds'] AAA reference slice; mods; XR; web; ML features behind optional contracts.\n{\n \"_doc\": \"Technology radar. Every non-established capability must appear here