).\\{0,80\\}\" data/*.json docs/00-design-principles.md docs/06-gap-analysis.md docs/07-research-plan.md | head -30","description":"Grep for specific omissions"}},"apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CfY38jmB1rkQroVhpLjp3","attributionAgent":"general-purpose","type":"assistant","uuid":"8f5bcbdc-19e4-497c-bf01-cd1b1d8f65e4","timestamp":"2026-09-29T16:22:47.306Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","userType":"external","entrypoint":"remote_mobile","cwd":"/home/user/skills","sessionId":"64f15158-6a4e-5bdf-8a90-7f2bd7b05b82","version":"2.1.284","gitBranch":"claude/engine-skill-framework-phase1","slug":"warm-pondering-kernighan"}
{"parentUuid":"8f5bcbdc-19e4-497c-bf01-cd1b1d8f65e4","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"9bdfc07b-8ff1-4e95-9c88-de7440fd6192","agentId":"a0890b76854d165da","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01WyCrMWN2iQCSZ97PdCaWgq","type":"tool_result","content":"data/capabilities.json:tform extensions: segregated modules/repos, public stubs, sanitized CI results, access classes\",\ndata/capabilities.json:       \"Layered configuration, cvars, command line, per-platform/device and remote layers with precedence\",\ndata/capabilities.json:       \"Vetted cryptographic primitives wrapper, CSPRNG, per-platform selection\",\ndata/capabilities.json:       \"Deterministic, incremental, per-platform cook architecture\",\ndata/capabilities.json:       \"Runtime texture formats\",\ndata/capabilities.json:       \"Accessibility input (hold/toggle, one-switch, copilot)\",\ndata/contracts.json:   \"summary\": \"Ownership ledger with access classes; write sets by module convention (src/<skill-id>/, tools/<skill-id>/; tests o\ndata/radar.json:   \"revisit\": \"Offline & cache policy validated on target platforms\",\ndata/radar.json:   \"revisit\": \"Latency parity with custom UDP on target platforms\",\ndata/skills.json:ontent pipeline: asset registry and dependency graph, deterministic incremental per-platform cooking, the cook-step contract, derived-data cache and content-addressed store\ndata/skills.json:   \"purpose\": \"Runtime texture formats, mip streaming, sampler-feedback streaming, virtual texturing, streaming-frien\ndata/skills.json:ata tables and row references, curve assets, tuning assets with inheritance and per-platform/difficulty variants, spreadsheet round-trip, balance simulation, and live data \ndocs/00-design-principles.md:- **Target platforms.** `pc`, `console`, `mobile`, `web`, `xr-standalone` or `server-host`.\ndocs/00-design-principles.md:n specification, validation layers and release cadence. NDA code needs separate access classes (`PLAT.PAL.confidential-extensions`). |","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"121016aa-7e3d-4c44-a953-5e93c08a9275","timestamp":"2026-09-29T16:22:47.426Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"8f5bcbdc-19e4-497c-bf01-cd1b1d8f65e4","userType":"external","entrypoint":"remote_mobile","cwd":"/home/user/skills","sessionId":"64f15158-6a4e-5bdf-8a90-7f2bd7b05b82","version":"2.1.284","gitBranch":"claude/engine-skill-framework-phase1","slug":"warm-pondering-kernighan"}
