{"parentUuid":"2c9be7ba-e273-4c2d-9f2f-4c23914a70f9","isSidechain":true,"agentId":"a0890b76854d165da","attachment":{"type":"total_tokens_reminder","text":"<total_tokens>14866204 tokens left</total_tokens>"},"type":"attachment","uuid":"1062ac5c-afdd-49c1-abad-f6a24e97f951","timestamp":"2026-09-29T16:24:24.491Z","rendered":[{"content":"<system-reminder>\n<total_tokens>14866204 tokens left</total_tokens>\n</system-reminder>"}],"userType":"external","entrypoint":"remote_mobile","cwd":"/home/user/skills","sessionId":"64f15158-6a4e-5bdf-8a90-7f2bd7b05b82","version":"2.1.284","gitBranch":"claude/engine-skill-framework-phase1","slug":"warm-pondering-kernighan"}
{"parentUuid":"1062ac5c-afdd-49c1-abad-f6a24e97f951","isSidechain":true,"agentId":"a0890b76854d165da","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CfY3LCxbRwB2yFU5fMRPv","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I found 16 findings: 1 blocker, 9 major and 6 minor. They are written to `/tmp/claude-0/-home-user-skills/64f15158-6a4e-5bdf-8a90-7f2bd7b05b82/scratchpad/r2/engine-skill-framework/gauntlet/round-2/K-PLATFORM.md`.\n\n**Blocker (probably a planted seed):**\n- **K-PLATFORM-1:** `platform-console` is tagged `[\"pc\"]`. That puts the NDA console module and its console RHI backends into every PC-only build and every tools build. A console-only configuration would contain no console module at all, and the checker stays green.\n\n**Major:**\n- **K-PLATFORM-2:** `docs/00-design-principles.md` says `check.py` proves every configuration has an implementer for each of its platforms. The code only checks for one implementer anywhere in the configuration. This gap is why K-PLATFORM-1 passes the gate.\n- **K-PLATFORM-3:** The platform abstraction layer contract (`C-PAL`) has no implementer slots. The desktop, mobile, web and console skills use it instead of implementing it, so the platform lead and the OS experts would both write the same OS code, such as Win32 windowing.\n- **K-PLATFORM-4:** No skill covers the `server-host` platform. `platform-desktop` claims \"server host OS\" but is tagged PC-only, and the server host OS capability sits with the networking skill `dedicated-server`.\n- **K-PLATFORM-5:** Console graphics backends are folded into `platform-console`. This breaks the framework's own rule of one skill per graphics API, and the three related skills name each other as the owner.\n- **K-PLATFORM-6:** NDA access is not modelled. One console skill spans all platform holders, and domain skills own console-specific IO, audio, save, crash and system-keyboard code with no access class.\n- **K-PLATFORM-7:** Tools configurations list only the machine the tools run on, not the platforms they cook, package and deploy for.\n- **K-PLATFORM-8:** The platform-user model is owned by the console-only skill, although PC, mobile, input pairing and saves all depend on it.\n- **K-PLATFORM-9:** XR coverage misses visionOS, console-tethered XR (PS VR2 class) and Android XR specifics.\n- **K-PLATFORM-10:** Hardware \"tiers\" are defined in five skills, and two skills each keep a driver/device deny-list.\n\n**Minor:**\n- **K-PLATFORM-11:** No configuration pairs a lightweight 3D profile with a portable console.\n- **K-PLATFORM-12:** Three platform skills list build targets they never ship in.\n- **K-PLATFORM-13:** Cloud streaming has an interposed \"cloud encoder\" in the present contract that no skill implements.\n- **K-PLATFORM-14:** On-device test runs are gated to large teams only.\n- **K-PLATFORM-15:** Steam Input and OS-level controller remapping are not represented.\n- **K-PLATFORM-16:** The WebGPU fallback names a WebGL backend nobody owns, and the web skills sit in milestone M5, whose configuration contains neither of them.\n\n1 blocker, 9 major, 6 minor, in `/tmp/claude-0/-home-user-skills/64f15158-6a4e-5bdf-8a90-7f2bd7b05b82/scratchpad/r2/engine-skill-framework/gauntlet/round-2/K-PLATFORM.md`"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":10100,"cache_read_input_tokens":123833,"output_tokens":1202,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":10100},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1202,"cache_read_input_tokens":123833,"cache_creation_input_tokens":10100,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":10100,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CfY3LCeEq89YsVn7Eii3z","attributionAgent":"general-purpose","type":"assistant","uuid":"09657de6-c8bc-4268-aaa5-5d7374f4bd99","timestamp":"2026-09-29T16:24:37.169Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","userType":"external","entrypoint":"remote_mobile","cwd":"/home/user/skills","sessionId":"64f15158-6a4e-5bdf-8a90-7f2bd7b05b82","version":"2.1.284","gitBranch":"claude/engine-skill-framework-phase1","slug":"warm-pondering-kernighan"}
